        {
          "id": "184feb60-0ba4-4df6-8251-4da121749f2a",
          "fact_type": "world",
          "text": "During a session, the agent should update the checkpoint file in place, preferring to rewrite current sections over appending narrative notes, and only appending a dated note for genuinely useful milestones or dead ends. | To maintain a concise and up-to-date record of the session's state.",
          "context": "pi-ghosty agent session transcript",
          "date": "2026-04-30T15:14:50.902152+00:00",
          "chunk_id": "pi-ghosty-procedural_project:pi-ghosty/coordinator/001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c_160",
          "proof_count": 1,
          "tags": [
            "agent:coordinator",
            "session:001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c",
            "project:pi-ghosty"
          ],
          "entities": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "b89903e3-f9e2-433f-b220-1ccd5be4047b",
          "fact_type": "world",
          "text": "At the start of a session, the default behavior is to run the 'checkpoint' command, read any existing checkpoint, and refresh it if it is stale or empty. | To establish a baseline context before starting substantial work.",
          "context": "pi-ghosty agent session transcript",
          "date": "2026-04-30T15:14:50.892152+00:00",
          "chunk_id": "pi-ghosty-procedural_project:pi-ghosty/coordinator/001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c_160",
          "proof_count": 1,
          "tags": [
            "agent:coordinator",
            "session:001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c",
            "project:pi-ghosty"
          ],
          "entities": "checkpoint"
        },
        {
          "id": "968f4cd3-aa08-4a07-b995-5108a13b4502",
          "fact_type": "world",
          "text": "The required sections to maintain in the checkpoint file are Current Goal, Current State, Decisions, Open Problems, and Resume Instructions. | To provide a structured summary of the session's progress and status.",
          "context": "pi-ghosty agent session transcript",
          "date": "2026-04-30T15:14:50.882152+00:00",
          "chunk_id": "pi-ghosty-procedural_project:pi-ghosty/coordinator/001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c_160",
          "proof_count": 1,
          "tags": [
            "agent:coordinator",
            "session:001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c",
            "project:pi-ghosty"
          ],
          "entities": "Current State, Current Goal, Resume Instructions, Decisions, Open Problems"
        },
        {
          "id": "91c66193-c606-48c6-ad99-94b5dcb4e397",
          "fact_type": "world",
          "text": "The file location policy for checkpoints depends on the current working directory: use CHECKPOINT.md in task-roots, notes/session-checkpoint.md in git repos, ~/CHECKPOINT.md under the home tree outside a repo/task root, or CHECKPOINT.md in the current directory otherwise. | To ensure the checkpoint file is saved in the correct location relative to the project structure.",
          "context": "pi-ghosty agent session transcript",
          "date": "2026-04-30T15:14:50.872152+00:00",
          "chunk_id": "pi-ghosty-procedural_project:pi-ghosty/coordinator/001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c_160",
          "proof_count": 1,
          "tags": [
            "agent:coordinator",
            "session:001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c",
            "project:pi-ghosty"
          ],
          "entities": "task-root, git repo"
        },
        {
          "id": "b0748ca0-a342-4508-a262-decefd34f119",
          "fact_type": "world",
          "text": "The goal of checkpointing is to leave a compact, high-signal resume artifact, not to mirror the full conversation history. | To allow another agent or a future session to use the artifact without rescanning the entire repository.",
          "context": "pi-ghosty agent session transcript",
          "date": "2026-04-30T15:14:50.862152+00:00",
          "chunk_id": "pi-ghosty-procedural_project:pi-ghosty/coordinator/001d4ec8-6fdd-428f-9b96-80d044dffe7c_160",
          "proof_count": 1,
